# Store images as ordinary Git files, not Git LFS: Vercel does not download LFS files by default,
# so the deployed app got pointer text instead of the images. See docs/decisions.
# "binary" stops Git from changing line endings or showing text diffs for these files.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.pdf   binary
